stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE_ONLY: __aiter__ starts<br/>_start_idle_phase

    IDLE_ONLY --> WARMING: push_audio(frame)<br/>start talking,<br/>idle keeps running

    WARMING --> TALKING: on_first_chunk<br/>_stop_idle_phase

    TALKING --> IDLE_ONLY: on_finished (talking task done)<br/>_restart_idle_phase

    WARMING --> IDLE_ONLY: interrupt()<br/>_stop_talking_phase<br/>+ _restart_idle_phase

    TALKING --> IDLE_ONLY: interrupt()<br/>_stop_talking_phase<br/>+ _restart_idle_phase

    IDLE_ONLY --> [*]: aclose()
    WARMING --> [*]: aclose()
    TALKING --> [*]: aclose()

    note right of WARMING
        Both slots set.
        Driver is still
        consuming idle stream.
    end note

    note right of TALKING
        Only talking slot set.
        Driver consuming
        talking stream.
    end note
